questions.question_es:
Un servicio de inferencia usa este patrón para cargar los pesos. ¿Qué imprime el fragmento?

```python
import functools

@functools.lru_cache(maxsize=1)
def cargar_modelo():
    print("cargando pesos")
    return "modelo"

for _ in range(3):
    cargar_modelo()
```

questions.question_en:
An inference service uses this pattern to load its weights. What does the snippet print?

```python
import functools

@functools.lru_cache(maxsize=1)
def load_model():
    print("loading weights")
    return "model"

for _ in range(3):
    load_model()
```
